iptproxy.patch: what go/iptproxy/build.sh changes in the sources it fetches,
applied with patch -p1 in the tree it prepares, after it deletes lyrebird's
internal/x25519ell2 and transports/meeklite/transport.go (LICENSE-001) and
puts go/meekutls/meekutls.go in the latter's place. Each file keeps its own
licence: IPtProxy's MIT, lyrebird's BSD-2-Clause.

* lyrebird/common/ntor/ntor.go: obfs4's handshake takes its Elligator 2 key
  hiding from go/hiddenkey.
* IPtProxy.go/go.mod: lyrebird at its tag and hiddenkey, from the trees beside it;
  golang.org/x/crypto, x/net, x/sys, x/text, brotli, klauspost/compress,
  edwards25519 and pion dtls/stun past the versions OSV reports advisories
  for, as go/hiddenkey, go/meekutls and interop/ require them.
* IPtProxy.go/go.sum: the checksums of those versions.

